sequenceDiagram
  actor Staff
  participant App as Live Monitor (React app)
  participant DB as Supabase (Postgres)

  Staff->>App: Search student by name or number
  App->>DB: select from students
  DB-->>App: matching student
  Staff->>App: Click Check in manually
  App->>DB: record_check_in(method = manual)
  DB->>DB: Skip window check, compute status, insert row
  DB-->>App: outcome, checked_in_at, status
  App-->>Staff: Show success and an Undo link
  Staff->>App: Click Undo
  App->>DB: undo_check_in(check_in_id)
  DB->>DB: Delete the check_ins row
  DB-->>App: success
  App-->>Staff: Check-in removed
